      "writtenOn": "2024-08-21T15:41:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, that was my reasoning as well - if we\u0027re worried about long-running programs, this is a poor proxy for that behavior. Internal limits are tough for users to work with, so lets just admit that this is a dangerous tool and you need to be smart.",
